    "long_instructions": "#Image Generation\r\n\r\nGenerate the images for your computer hardware metaphor, one piece at a time.\r\n\r\nDescribe things from your metaphor, not the computer parts themselves.\r\n\r\nModify the **context** and **task** in the system prompt as needed.\r\n",
